      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5b6b4e8cb1b04a6db0be465d|full_name}: VRChat likes to call itself part of the metaverse, but it felt a heck of a lot more 'metaversey' when the loading screen was in space. Now it feels like I'm in some kind of underwater cyber waiting room. \nI welcome the tips since new players can benefit from them, but the game feels less welcoming without the space background imo.\nI'd settle for something else even, I just really dislike the current load screen.",
